{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265yiLXGxptO1795440500.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>俄烏衝突持續。在外交部例行記者會上，有記者提問，上周中俄美元首會晤有否討論過烏克蘭危機。發言人回應，中方支持一切有利於和平的努力。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人郭嘉昆稱︰「關於中俄美元首會晤的情況，中方已經發布了消息。關於烏克蘭危機，中方的立場是一貫明確的，始終認為對話談判是解決危機的唯一可行出路，中方支持一切有利於和平的努力。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:36:50.538253+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T13:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T10:57:14.309618+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:29:09.252648+00:00","content_hash":"b9776b41274f43747828e5010044ec50c22b9cb25f13ff083f8540f752c99f5e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:36:50.538253+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}